          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP591 Elnora [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the last 8 years the most-found cap at Three Hills has gotten very difficult (the post is gone and the wheat field is healthy) but after that disappointment I came here for this easy one. I lingered for a while because the area was so peaceful. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

