My GPSr  N52 03.352  W113 17.451 - Cap is badly marked.

Email with info sent.

Boy, after driving down a very greasy road, this cap had to be easy to find......

T4TBCP

TeamDJM (8749)

Lethbridge Alberta&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
